# [PPM](../wg/ppm.html)

## Summary

The Privacy Preserving Measurement (PPM) Working Group met at IETF 120. The session focused on the progress of the core protocol draft [draft-ietf-ppm-dap](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-ppm-dap/), an introduction to the Preamble VDAF for large sparse vector aggregation, a procedural discussion regarding IANA code point registries for VDAFs, and potential integration with the proposed MOL (Measurement of Oblivious Limits / MOLE) effort. The working group agreed to proceed with Working Group Last Call (WGLC) for [draft-ietf-ppm-dap](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-ppm-dap/) following minor updates.

